@startuml classes_design
' =====================================================================
' Design Class Diagram — TOP-LEVEL PACKAGE OVERVIEW
' (RUP Logical View - Construction phase). Scope: HU1-HU4.
' This is the "index" diagram: it shows only the design packages and
' their dependencies. Each package is detailed in its own class diagram:
'   - classes_design_frontend.puml
'   - classes_design_cross-cutting.puml
'   - classes_design_controllers.puml
'   - classes_design_services.puml
'   - classes_design_dtos.puml
'   - classes_design_persistence.puml
'   - classes_design_domain.puml
' =====================================================================

allowmixing
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
left to right direction

title Design — Package Overview (HU1–HU4) · Angular + NestJS + MongoDB

actor "Business Administrator\n(Tenant)" as admin
actor "End Customer" as customer

package "Frontend — Angular 22 (boundary)" as frontend
package "API — Controllers" as controllers
package "API — Application Services" as services
package "API — DTOs" as dtos
package "API — Persistence (Mongoose)" as persistence
package "Domain Documents (MongoDB)" as domain
package "Cross-cutting (Multitenant)" as crosscut
package "OTP Verification (HU5 frontier)" as otp #EEEEEE

' --- Actors reach the SPA ---
admin --> frontend
customer --> frontend

' --- Request flow (top to bottom of the stack) ---
frontend ..> controllers : REST / HTTPS
controllers ..> services : delegates
controllers ..> dtos : request/response contracts
controllers ..> crosscut : tenant context (middleware/guard)
services ..> persistence : reads/writes
services ..> domain : returns/handles entities
services ..> dtos : consumes
services ..> otp : startVerification (HU5)
persistence ..> domain : maps documents
persistence ..> crosscut : extends TenantAwareRepository
dtos ..> domain : reuses enums (Weekday, ...)

note bottom of crosscut
  Multitenant isolation: TenantContextMiddleware resolves the
  tenant_id per request and TenantAwareRepository forces every
  query to be scoped by tenant_id.
end note

note bottom of otp
  Out of HU1–HU4 scope. HU4 only hands off to start the
  OTP verification flow (HU5).
end note
@enduml
